sts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Thanks for looking into the issue!\nThis looks good 🏅 , but I think we can make it slightly better by doing this instead:\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/core/io/ip_address.cpp b/core/io/ip_address.cpp\nindex 2918f51f41..03e6e355f8 100644\n--- a/core/io/ip_address.cpp\n+++ b/core/io/ip_address.cpp\n@@ -135,8 +135,8 @@ bool IPAddress::_parse_ipv6(const String &p_string, IPAddress &r_ip) {\n \t\treturn cur == 8; // Should have parsed 8 16-bits ints.\n \t} else if (shift > 7) {\n \t\treturn false; // Can't shorten more than this.\n-\t} else if (shift == cur) {\n-\t\treturn true; // Nothing to do, end is assumed zeroized.\n+\t} else if (shift == cur || cur == 8) {\n+\t\treturn true; // Nothing to do (fields are assumed zeroized).\n \t}\n \t// Shift bytes.\n \tint pad = 8 - cur;\n@@ -146,6 +146,7 @@ bool IPAddress::_parse_ipv6(const String &p_string, IPAddress &r_ip) {\n \t\t\tr_ip.field16[i] = 0;\n \t\t} else {\n \t\t\tr_ip.field16[i] = r_ip.field16[i - pad];\n+\t\t\tr_ip.field16[i - pad] = 0;\n \t\t}\n \t}\n \treturn true;\n```\n\nwhich would save us a few `if`s.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118055#pullrequestreview-4143099243","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118055","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118055#pullrequestreview-4143099243"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118055"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-20T20:06:33Z","commit_id":"56ad99d45bab14fba5644f33d965d9cab123b26e"}]